# The four canonical shared files. The copy of record is lfr-tunnel master;
# these are copies and must stay byte-identical, which the sync step in
# .github/workflows/docs.yml enforces. Prettier rewrites three of them - the
# stylesheet most heavily - so formatting them here would break that parity
# silently, on the next unrelated `prettier --write`. The hook is listed too:
# Prettier does not format Python today, and the list is the record of what
# must not be touched rather than a list of what Prettier would reach.
# See #1321 and #1329.
docs/assets/stylesheets/liferay-blue.css
scripts/mkdocs_github_alerts.py
overrides/main.html
overrides/partials/copyright.html
